<title>HONG KONG: BADMINTON-HONG KONG OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-HONG KONG OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the Hong Kong Open badminton tournament on Saturday:</p>
<p>Men's singles semifinals</p>
<p>3/4-Fung Permadi (Taiwan) beat 5/8-Budi Santoso (Indonesia) 15-9 10-15 15-10</p>
<p>9/16-Salim (Indonesia) beat 3/4 Thomas Stuer-Lauridsen (Denmark) 15-11 15-10</p>
<p>Women's singles semifinals</p>
<p>1-Mia Audina (Indonesia) beat 3/4-Kim Ji-hyun (South Korea) 11-3 11-3</p>
<p>2-Camilla Martin (Denmark) beat 5/8-Ra Kyung-min (South Korea) 6-11 11-4 12-11.</p>
</text>
